            <ArticleTitle>The influence of pulsed high peak power electromagnetic energy (Diapulse) treatment on posttraumatic algoneurodystrophies.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>77-81</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Forty-five patients with post-traumatic algoneurodystrophies were treated with Diapulse therapy (high peak power electromagnetic energy). This therapy accelerates the healing of the disease inducing a recovery of the damaged bone structure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
